<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπλέκ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>connect with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					10.7
				</span></i>
			; <i>mix with</i> a medicine, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.645
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>cling to, attach oneself</i> or <i>be attached
			to</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.60.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.796b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴδει ἑτέρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					84
				</span></i>
			; in hostile sense, <i>attack</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ Διονύσῳ</span> Arg.<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
			</span></i>; <i>fasten upon</i>, in argument, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέξει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.176
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be mixed up with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυθώδη τινὰ -πέπλεκται τοῖς λεγομένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					1.1.10
				</span></i>
			; of astrological relationship, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				119.27
			</span></i>.</div>
